The task's examples:
{A,B}, {C,D}
    -> {A,B}, {C,D}
{A,B}, {B,D}
    -> {A,B,D}
{A,B}, {C,D}, {D,B}
    -> {A,B,C,D}
{H,I,K}, {A,B}, {C,D}, {D,B}, {F,G,H}
    -> {A,B,C,D}, {F,G,H,I,K}

A sixth set that joins the two:
{H,I,K}, {A,B}, {C,D}, {D,B}, {F,G,H}, {A,H}
    -> {A,B,C,D,F,G,H,I,K}

Fewer than two sets, and a set alone among others:
{A,B,C}
    -> {A,B,C}
{E}, {A,B}, {B,C}, {X,Y,Z}, {C,A}
    -> {A,B,C}, {E}, {X,Y,Z}

The six sets in all 720 orders: 720 consolidate to {A,B,C,D,F,G,H,I,K}
